    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and unravel the mysteries of Rheksetor while making your citizens happy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rheksetor is a hybrid of open world shooter and colony builder, featuring some of the best elements from both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now rebuilt in GODOT!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Current Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Structure type selection and building </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">City management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unique and detailed visual style and auditory elements, designed to maximize the immersive experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Planned Features (Q2 2025):</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A large world to explore and exploit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More structures to build</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More resources to gather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Varying resource yields across the world adding complexity to colony planning</p></li></ul>",
